True Positive', 'email': {'sample_id': 2, 'metadata': {'from': 'msagel@home.com', 'to': 'jarnold@enron.com', 'cc': '', 'bcc': '', 'subject': 'Agreement'}, 'body': "John:\n\nHope you did ok today.\n\nAs I said yesterday, the poor close Monday should lead to additional market weakness, which we saw today.\nYou indicated that you would mail the service agreement back to me. I don't know if you have the mailing address, so here it is:\nPsytech Analytics\n11604 Greenspring Ave.\nLutherville, MD? 21093\n\nSpeak to you over phone later during the day once I have decent set-up on my work for natural.\n\nFeel free to ding me on whatsapp anytime.\n\nMark", 'raw_email': "From : msagel@home.com\nTo: jarnold@enron.com\nSubject : Agreement\nBody: John:\n\nHope you did ok today.\n\nAs I said yesterday, the poor close Monday should lead to additional market weakness, which we saw today.\nYou indicated that you would mail the service agreement back to me. I don't know if you have the mailing address, so here it is:\nPsytech Analytics\n11604 Greenspring Ave.\nLutherville, MD? 21093\n\nSpeak to you over phone later during the day once I have decent set-up on my work for natural.\n\nFeel free to ding me on whatsapp anytime.\n\nMark", 'ground_truths': {'category': 'Change in communication', 'classification': 'True Positive'}}, 'analysis': {'Outside_Party_Involved': True, 'Sender': 'msagel@home.com', 'Is_Non_Compliance': False, 'Categories': [], 'Evidence': [], 'Evidence_Strength': [], 'Summary': 'No compliance violation was identified in the email.', 'Reason_For_Flagging': 'The email contains normal business communication and does not provide evidence of any compliance violation.', 'Confidence': 95, 'Risk_Score': 0.0, 'Priority': 'Low', 'Review_Required': False, 'Review_Status': 'No Review Required', 'Category_Risk_Details': []}}, {'email_id': 3, 'expected_category': 'Complaints', 'expected_classification': 'False Positive', 'email': {'sample_id': 3, 'metadata': {'from': 'outlook.team@e