2026-08-10 16:23:57,734 | INFO | Compliance-Surveillance | Compliance :: [{'email_id': 1, 'expected_category': 'Secrecy', 'expected_classification': 'False Positive', 'email': {'sample_id': 1, 'metadata': {'from': 'trey.comiskey@enron.com', 'to': 'kenneth.cooper@am.sony.com', 'cc': '', 'bcc': '', 'subject': 'Agreement of Confidentiality'}, 'body': 'Ken - Thanks again for your time yesterday.\n\nHere is the C.A. per our discussion, signature and faxing back to me at 713.853.0528.\n\nPls do not disclose the C.A. until it is signed by the appropriate party here, we will have a fully-signed copy faxed to you for your records.\n\nShould you have questions or comments, please Mr. Comiskey.\n\nThank you.', 'raw_email': 'From : trey.comiskey@enron.com\nTo: kenneth.cooper@am.sony.com\nSubject : Agreement of Confidentiality\nBody: Ken - Thanks again for your time yesterday.\n\nHere is the C.A. per our discussion, signature and faxing back to me at 713.853.0528.\n\nPls do not disclose the C.A. until it is signed by the appropriate party here, we will have a fully-signed copy faxed to you for your records.\n\nShould you have questions or comments, please Mr. Comiskey.\n\nThank you.', 'ground_truths': {'category': 'Secrecy', 'classification': 'False Positive'}}, 'analysis': {'Outside_Party_Involved': True, 'Sender': 'trey.comiskey@enron.com', 'Is_Non_Compliance': False, 'Categories': [], 'Evidence': [], 'Evidence_Strength': [], 'Summary': 'No compliance violation was identified in the email.', 'Reason_For_Flagging': 'The email contains a legitimate confidentiality instruction regarding the disclosure of the agreement until it is signed, which does not indicate non-compliance.', 'Confidence': 100, 'Risk_Score': 0.0, 'Priority': 'Low', 'Review_Required': False, 'Review_Status': 'No Review Required', 'Category_Risk_Details': []}}, {'email_id': 2, 'expected_category': 'Change in communication', 'expected_classification': 'True Positive', 'email': {'sample_id': 2, 'metadata': {'from': 'msagel@home.com', 'to': 'jarnold@enron.com', 'cc': '', 'bcc': '', 'subject': 'Agreement'}, 'body': "John:\n\nHope you did ok today.\n\nAs I said yesterday, the poor close Monday should lead to additional market weakness, which we saw today.\nYou indicated that you would mail the service agreement back to me. I don't know if you have the mailing address, so here it is:\nPsytech Analytics\n11604 Greenspring Ave.\nLutherville, MD? 21093\n\nSpeak to you over phone later during the day once I have decent set-up on my work for natural.\n\nFeel free to ding me on whatsapp anytime.\n\nMark", 'raw_email': "From : msagel@home.com\nTo: jarnold@enron.com\nSubject : Agreement\nBody: John:\n\nHope you did ok today.\n\nAs I said yesterday, the poor close Monday should lead to additional market weakness, which we saw today.\nYou indicated that you would mail the service agreement back to me. I don't know if you have the mailing address, so here it is:\nPsytech Analytics\n11604 Greenspring Ave.\nLutherville, MD? 21093\n\nSpeak to you over phone later during the day once I have decent set-up on my work for natural.\n\nFeel free to ding me on whatsapp anytime.\n\nMark", 'ground_truths': {'category': 'Change in communication', 'classification': 'True Positive'}}, 'analysis': {'Outside_Party_Involved': True, 'Sender': 'msagel@home.com', 'Is_Non_Compliance': False, 'Categories': [], 'Evidence': [], 'Evidence_Strength': [], 'Summary': 'No compliance violation was identified in the email.', 'Reason_For_Flagging': 'The email contains normal business communication and does not provide evidence of any compliance violation.', 'Confidence': 95, 'Risk_Score': 0.0, 'Priority': 'Low', 'Review_Required': False, 'Review_Status': 'No Review Required', 'Category_Risk_Details': []}}, {'email_id': 3, 'expected_category': 'Complaints', 'expected_classification': 'False Positive', 'email': {'sample_id': 3, 'metadata': {'from': 'outlook.team@enron.com', 'to': 'aimee.shek@enron.com, albino.lopez@enron.co